activate                Show how to activate the project in a shell
add                     Add packages to the project
cache_clean             Remove cached package downloads
completions             Generate shell completions (bash, zsh, fish,
                        powershell)
doctor                  Diagnose environment issues (R, build tools,
                        project status)
export                  Export lockfile to renv.lock format
import                  Import renv lockfile to create uvr.toml
init                    Initialize a new uvr project
install_uvr             Install the uvr binary
lock                    Update the lockfile
r_install               Install an R version
r_list                  List R versions
r_pin                   Pin the R version
r_use                   Set the R version constraint
remove_pkgs             Remove packages from the project
run                     Run an R script in the project environment
scan                    Find packages your code uses but the manifest
                        does not declare
sync                    Synchronize project library from lockfile
tree                    Show the dependency tree
update_pkgs             Update installed packages to the latest allowed
                        versions
update_uvr              Update uvr (R package + CLI binary)
